// Ficha Dev signs with Lucas's paid team: on the Mac with Apple Development,
// in its sandbox (#304), and on the iPhone automatically (#97). So does the
// real Ficha that make install builds, to reach its App Group's folder
// (#309). The team's ID stays out of the repo, in iPhone/Local.xcconfig, which
// git ignores: a line like `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345`, as
// docs/development.md explains. Without it, as in CI, the Makefile builds
// Ficha Dev unsigned, and the iPhone app still builds for the simulator, but
// not for an iPhone, and make install stops.
#include? "iPhone/Local.xcconfig"
